    "title": "khessni ___ — I need",
    "body": "**khessni** ('I need') + a noun or verb is your fastest way to ask for help:\n*khessni tbib* (I need a doctor) · *khessni dwa* (I need medicine) · *khessni n3ayyet* (I need to call).\nIn Morocco the **pharmacy (farmasian)** is the first stop for minor issues — pharmacists advise and dispense a lot without a doctor's visit."
  },
  "canDo": [
    "Ask for help and call a doctor or the police",
    "Say you're sick, in pain, or allergic",
    "Get medicine from a pharmacy"
  ],
